#Протокол_Agent_State_Machine_V1<[
Базис:
  ioHasC agent orchestrator накопил эвристики в одном файле; Work Graph rebuild требует явной state machine отдельно от LLM transport и tool policy.
  protocols/agent-worker-adapter.bvc уже описывает worker input/output; state machine задаёт operator-visible phases до и после provider run.
Вектор:
  Зафиксировать состояния: observe, plan, claim, act, verify, record, stop.
  Tool policy и allowedTools живут отдельно от transport (OpenAI/Cursor/local CLI).
  Context assembly: current WorkItem snapshot, bounded memorySlice, trace/evidence summaries, targetFiles facts — без replay chat transcript.
Цель:
  Agent loop выполняет Work Graph task предсказуемо, с явной остановкой и записью результата.

Проверки:
  есть список состояний и переходов
  есть минимальный набор tools
  есть правило остановки и записи результата

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  protocol.id: agent-state-machine-v1
  work.source: design-agent-state-machine
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Состояния_Agent_Loop<[
Базис:
  Каждая фаза должна иметь одну ответственность и наблюдаемый output для operator dashboard.
Вектор:
  observe: read Work Graph snapshot, blocked/ready queues, recent evidence and memory slice; no side effects.
  plan: propose next_action, target files and checks for current or selected task; may create StepAtomDraft proposal only through Work Graph tools.
  claim: select claimable ready task via claimNext policy; transition to claimed/doing; record claim evidence.
  act: invoke agent worker adapter with Worker Input v1; bounded tools on targetFiles; collect patchSummary and worker-run evidence.
  verify: run deterministic verification commands from task checks or domain policy; transition to verify status when proposal needs gate.
  record: normalize Worker Output to Evidence v1 strings; apply transitionStatus only through runtime policy gates.
  stop: end run when done/blocked/cancelled/needs_human; no hidden retries without new evidence.
Цель:
  Operator can trace which phase failed without reading provider logs first.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: agent-state-states-v1
  protocol.id: agent-state-machine-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Переходы_And_Stop_Rules<[
Базис:
  State machine must not invent transitions that bypass Work Graph policy.
Вектор:
  observe -> plan when operator or scheduler selects a task focus.
  plan -> claim when task is ready and dependencies satisfied.
  claim -> act after successful claim transition and Worker Input build.
  act -> verify when worker proposes verify/done and checks require command/test/manual review.
  verify -> record when verification evidence succeeded or failed explicitly.
  record -> stop when transition applied or blocked by policy with actionable error.
  act -> stop on cancelled run or needs_human without silent done.
  Any phase -> stop on timeout, policy denial or operator cancel.
Цель:
  Failures surface as blocked/ready with evidence, not as stuck provider session.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: agent-state-transitions-v1
  protocol.id: agent-state-machine-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Minimal_Tool_Set_And_Policy<[
Базис:
  Tool surface must stay small and aligned with Work Graph runtime, not IDE monolith.
Вектор:
  MVP tools: claimNext (read/select), recordEvidence, transitionStatus, read snapshot/target file facts, run bounded verification command (sidecar/local runner).
  toolPolicy separates: filesystem write scope (targetFiles), network (off by default), shell (verification allowlist only), memory write (draft/needs-review only).
  LLM transport is not a tool; provider selection follows agent-worker-adapter capability matrix.
Цель:
  Agent acts through policy-gated Work Graph operations instead of ad-hoc file edits.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: agent-minimal-tool-set-v1
  protocol.id: agent-state-machine-v1
